{"speciesId":78,"names":{"fr":"Galopa","es":"Rapidash","en":"Rapidash","ja":"ギャロップ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"Very competitive, this POKéMON will chase anything that moves fast in the hopes of racing it."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"Very competitive, this POKéMON will chase anything that moves fast in the hopes of racing it."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"Just loves to run. If it sees some­ thing faster than itself, it will give chase at top speed."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"At full gallop, its four hooves barely touch the ground because it moves so incredi­ bly fast."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"With incredible acceleration, it reaches its top speed of 150 mph after running just ten steps."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It just loves to gallop. The faster it goes, the long­ er the swaying flames of its mane will become."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"RAPIDASH usually can be seen casually cantering in the fields and plains. However, when this POKéMON turns serious, its fiery manes flare and blaze as it gallops its way up to 150 mph."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"RAPIDASH usually can be seen casually cantering in the fields and plains. However, when this POKéMON turns serious, its fiery manes flare and blaze as it gallops its way up to 150 mph."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It usually canters casually in the fields and plains. But once a RAPIDASH turns serious, its fiery manes flare and blaze as it gallops its way up to 150 mph."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It can gallop at a top speed of 150 miles per hour. It can race as fast as a bullet train while ablaze."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Very competitive, this POKéMON will chase anything that moves fast in the hopes of racing it."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It gallops at nearly 150 mph. With its mane blazing ferociously, it races as if it were an arrow."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It has astounding acceleration. From a standstill, it can reach top speed within 10 steps."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"When at an all-out gallop, its blazing mane sparkles, enhancing its beautiful appearance."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"At full gallop, its four hooves barely touch the ground because it moves so incredibly fast."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"With incredible acceleration, it reaches its top speed of 150 mph after running just 10 steps."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Au grand galop, sa crinière de feu disperse au vent une myriade d’étincelles ardentes."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"When at an all-out gallop, its blazing mane sparkles, enhancing its beautiful appearance."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Au grand galop, sa crinière de feu disperse au vent une myriade d’étincelles ardentes."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"When at an all-out gallop, its blazing mane sparkles, enhancing its beautiful appearance."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"When at an all-out gallop, its blazing mane sparkles, enhancing its beautiful appearance."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"When at an all-out gallop, its blazing mane sparkles, enhancing its beautiful appearance."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Doté d’un esprit de compétition, il poursuit toute créature rapide pour faire la course."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Muy competitivo, este Pokémon perseguirá a todo lo que se mueva rápido e intentará salir airoso."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Very competitive, this Pokémon will chase anything that moves fast in the hopes of racing it."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"速く 動く 物体を 見ると 競争したくなり 猛烈な スピードで 追いかけはじめる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Son galop dépasse les 240 km/h. Il file comme une flèche, laissant flotter sa crinière ardente."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Galopa a casi 240 km por hora. Su crin ardiente parece una flecha cuando corre."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It gallops at nearly 150 mph. With its mane blazing ferociously, it races as if it were an arrow."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"走る 速度は 時速２４０キロ。 たてがみの 炎が 激しく 燃え 矢のように 駆け抜ける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"On voit souvent Galopa trotter dans les champs et les plaines. Cependant, lorsque ce Pokémon s’en donne la peine, il peut galoper à plus de 240 km/h et sa crinière flamboyante s’embrase."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"A Rapidash se le suele ver trotando sin rumbo fijo por los campos y llanos. Cuando tiene que ir a algún sitio en concreto, se le aviva el fuego de las melenas y emprende el galope llameante llegando a los 240 km/h."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Rapidash usually can be seen casually cantering in the fields and plains. However, when this Pokémon turns serious, its fiery manes flare and blaze as it gallops its way up to 150 mph."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"いつもは のんびり 野原を 駆けまわっているが 一度 本気を 出すと たてがみの 炎が 燃えあがり 時速２４０キロで 走りだす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"On voit souvent Galopa trotter dans les champs et les plaines. Cependant, lorsque ce Pokémon s’en donne la peine, il peut galoper à plus de 240 km/h et sa crinière flamboyante s’embrase."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"A Rapidash se le suele ver trotando sin rumbo fijo por los campos y llanos. Cuando tiene que ir a algún sitio en concreto, se le aviva el fuego de las melenas y emprende el galope llameante llegando a los 240 km/h."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Rapidash usually can be seen casually cantering in the fields and plains. However, when this Pokémon turns serious, its fiery manes flare and blaze as it gallops its way up to 150 mph."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"いつもは のんびり 野原を 駆けまわっているが 一度 本気を 出すと たてがみの 炎が 燃えあがり 時速２４０キロで 走りだす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Il aime la course. Il poursuit tout ce qui va plus vite que lui. Question d’honneur."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Le encanta galopar. Si ve algo más rápido, intentará alcanzarlo a toda velocidad."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Just loves to run. If it sees something faster than itself, it will give chase at top speed."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"とにかく 走るのが 大好きで 自分より 速いものを 見つけると 全速力で 追いかける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Il aime la course. Il poursuit tout ce qui va plus vite que lui. Question d’honneur."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Le encanta galopar. Si ve algo más rápido, intentará alcanzarlo a toda velocidad."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Just loves to run. If it sees something faster than itself, it will give chase at top speed."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"とにかく 走るのが 大好きで 自分より 速いものを 見つけると 全速力で 追いかける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ce Pokémon traverse les plaines à plus de 240 km/h, sa crinière flamboyante flottant au vent."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Su ardiente crin ondea al viento mientras atraviesa extensas praderas a una velocidad de 240 km/h."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon can be seen galloping through fields at speeds of up to 150 mph, its fiery mane fluttering in the wind."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"燃える たてがみを はためかせ 時速 ２４０キロの 速度で 大草原を 駆けぬけるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Au sein d’un troupeau, c’est le plus rapide qui devient le chef. Il choisit les lieux où se rendre et détermine la vitesse de galop."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"El ejemplar más rápido se convierte en el líder de la manada y decide tanto el ritmo de galope como su destino."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"The fastest runner becomes the leader, and it decides the herd’s pace and direction of travel."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"いちばん 脚が 速い ものが リーダー。 群れが 行く 場所や 走る 速度を 決めている。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Fiery mane aglow, Rapidash darts like an arrow across the land. This prodigiously swift creature can traverse the vast region of Hisui in a day and a half."}],"varieties":[{"id":78,"moves":[{"name":"pay-day","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"stomp","learns":[[1,"level-up",1],[1,"level-up",32],[2,"level-up",1],[2,"level-up",32],[3,"level-up",19],[4,"level-up",19],[5,"level-up",19],[6,"level-up",19],[7,"level-up",19],[8,"level-up",19],[9,"level-up",19],[10,"level-up",19],[11,"level-up",17],[12,"level-up",19],[13,"level-up",19],[14,"level-up",17],[15,"level-up",17],[16,"level-up",17],[17,"level-up",17],[18,"level-up",17],[19,"level-up",20],[20,"level-up",30],[23,"level-up",30],[28,"level-up",1],[28,"level-up",32],[29,"level-up",1],[29,"level-up",32]]},{"name":"double-kick","learns":[[19,"level-up",15]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0],[19,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fury-attack","learns":[[3,"level-up",40],[4,"level-up",40],[5,"level-up",40],[6,"level-up",40],[7,"level-up",40],[8,"level-up",40],[9,"level-up",40],[10,"level-up",40],[11,"level-up",40],[12,"level-up",40],[13,"level-up",40],[14,"level-up",40],[15,"level-up",40],[16,"level-up",40],[17,"level-up",0],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",0],[18,"level-up",1],[19,"level-up",0],[19,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"horn-drill","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[19,"level-up",1],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[19,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[24,"level